      "message": "fix(ui): name the platform command key in pick hints\n\nPick hints (edge hint, Click selects hover, boundary picking hint) and the\nshortcut comments say Ctrl (Cmd on macOS): add-to-selection uses egui's\ncommand modifier, so a bare Ctrl hint is wrong on a Mac. First-run docs\nname Cmd+Z / Cmd+Y on macOS too. Pinned by\npick_hints_name_the_platform_command_key.\n\nFixes #1238\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
